{
    "name": "领取奖励",
    "description": "领取奖励(含三个可用 if_config 开关): 功能1 claim_online【在线礼包】: 进面板->抽奖耗尽剩余次数(抽奖仅每日8时后开放, 用 if_time window=[8,23] 守卫, 0~7时整段跳过)->时间礼包从长到短领取->关闭; 功能2 claim_party【花灵派对】: navigate(公共注册表)进花灵派对->派对时长礼包->loop_text 有'领取'就点(领完按钮消失即停)->关闭; 功能3 claim_hb【奇妙花宝】: retry_loop(点-等-重试)进家园->点顶部工具栏'奇妙花宝'->点左侧'奇妙特权'页签->右侧'奇妙礼包'每日/每周/每月三档各自按区域限定绿勾判定是否已领, 未领则点该档圆形'领'按钮->关闭面板。任一开关设 false 则该功能整段跳过。",
    "steps": [
        { "_note": "===== 0. 归位守卫（2026-10-02）=====" },
        { "_note": "领取奖励的三个功能入口(在线礼包/花灵派对/奇妙花宝)都只在家园主界面可见。此前 social 结束停在好友列表时, in_home 误判为主界面, ensure_home 直接收工 -> 本模块整段空跑(2026-10-02 日志: 奖励领取几乎全未触发)。故本模块首步强制归位。" },
        { "type": "ensure_home", "delay": 0.5 },

        { "type": "if_config",
          "key": "claim_online",
          "value": true,
          "then": [
              { "type": "retry_loop",
                "max_rounds": 3,
                "do": [
                    { "type": "if_text",
                      "text": ["在线礼包"],
                      "min_score": 0.4,
                      "then": [
                          { "type": "click_text", "text": ["在线礼包"], "mark": true, "delay": 1.5, "fallback_rel": [0.8258, 0.2167] },
                          { "type": "sleep", "seconds": 1.5 }
                      ] }
                ] },
              { "_note": "抽奖只在每日 8 时后开放; 0~8 时整段跳过" },
              { "type": "if_time",
                "window": [8, 23],
                "then": [
                    { "type": "loop_times",
                      "times": 3,
                      "do": [
                          { "type": "if_greater",
                            "region_rel": [0.6047, 0.4931],
                            "condition": "N>0",
                            "then": [
                                { "type": "click_rel", "rel": [0.6102, 0.5681], "delay": 1.0, "name": "抽奖" },
                                { "type": "wait_text", "text": ["点击任意处关闭"], "timeout": 8, "interval": 1.0 },
                                { "type": "click_rel", "rel": [0.5, 0.9375], "delay": 1.5, "name": "关闭恭喜获得" }
                            ] }
                    ] }
                ],
                "else": [
                    { "type": "sleep", "seconds": 0.3 }
                ] },
              { "type": "count_text",
                "text": ["已领取"],
                "threshold": 3,
                "region_rel": [0.13, 0.1, 0.6, 0.9],
                "then": [],
                "else": [
                  { "type": "if_text",
                    "text": ["50分钟"],
                    "min_score": 0.5,
                    "region_rel": [0.13, 0.6, 0.25, 0.75],
                    "then": [
                        { "type": "click_rel", "rel": [0.1656, 0.6917], "delay": 1.0, "name": "领取50分钟(自动连领30/10)" },
                        { "type": "wait_text", "text": ["点击任意处关闭"], "timeout": 8, "interval": 1.0 },
                        { "type": "click_rel", "rel": [0.5, 0.9375], "delay": 1.5, "name": "关闭领取弹窗" }
                    ],
                    "else": [
                      { "type": "if_text",
                        "text": ["30分钟"],
                        "min_score": 0.5,
                        "region_rel": [0.13, 0.38, 0.25, 0.53],
                        "then": [
                            { "type": "click_rel", "rel": [0.1656, 0.4611], "delay": 1.0, "name": "领取30分钟(自动连领10)" },
                            { "type": "wait_text", "text": ["点击任意处关闭"], "timeout": 8, "interval": 1.0 },
                            { "type": "click_rel", "rel": [0.5, 0.9375], "delay": 1.5, "name": "关闭领取弹窗" }
                        ],
                        "else": [
                          { "type": "if_text",
                            "text": ["10分钟"],
                            "min_score": 0.5,
                            "region_rel": [0.13, 0.14, 0.25, 0.3],
                            "then": [
                                { "type": "click_rel", "rel": [0.1641, 0.2306], "delay": 1.0, "name": "领取10分钟" },
                                { "type": "wait_text", "text": ["点击任意处关闭"], "timeout": 8, "interval": 1.0 },
                                { "type": "click_rel", "rel": [0.5, 0.9375], "delay": 1.5, "name": "关闭领取弹窗" }
                            ] }
                        ] }
                    ] }
                ] },
              { "type": "close_dialog", "only_types": ["anchor_color"], "delay": 1.0, "name": "关闭在线礼包面板(锚点:在线礼包)",
                "_note": "改走锚点: 注册表新增「在线礼包」anchor_color 条目(标题@(202,90) 右侧 dx 700~1100 找粉花✕@(1105,97))。不再用通用的 close_online_small.png(仅17×21、各面板同形✕、到处 0.94+ 会误命中)" },
              { "type": "close_dialog", "only_types": ["anchor_color"], "delay": 1.0, "name": "复核再关一次" }
          ],
          "else": [] },
        { "type": "if_config",
          "key": "claim_party",
          "value": true,
          "then": [
              { "type": "navigate", "target": "花灵派对", "max_rounds": 3 },
              { "type": "if_text",
                "text": ["时长礼包"],
                "min_score": 0.4,
                "then": [
                    { "type": "click_text", "text": ["时长礼包"], "delay": 1.2,
                      "region_rel": [0.0, 0.36, 0.16, 0.60], "fallback_rel": [0.0531, 0.4250],
                      "_note": "区域限定在左侧导航带: 防止 OCR 命中子面板标题「派对时长礼包」(在 (639,58), 含『时长礼包』子串) 而不是左侧导航项" }
                ],
                "else": [
                    { "type": "click_rel", "rel": [0.0531, 0.4250], "delay": 1.2, "name": "派对时长礼包入口(兜底)" }
                ] },
              { "type": "sleep", "seconds": 1.0 },
              { "type": "loop_text",
                "text": ["领取"],
                "min_score": 0.4,
                "region_rel": [0.20, 0.38, 0.80, 0.72],
                "exclude": ["已领取"],
                "_note": "区域限定: 「领取」在花灵派对面板里出现多次(不同高度), 单一均值必然对不上, 限定在领取按钮带内即可跳过均值复核(避免正确命中被缓存误杀)。exclude 排除「已领取」: 关键字是子串匹配, 『领取』会命中『已领取』, 点已领的按钮当然什么都不会发生(2026-09-28 日志: 8 次空点同一坐标, 无一次出现『恭喜获得』)",
                "max_loop": 8,
                "do": [
                    { "type": "click_text", "text": ["领取"], "min_score": 0.4,
                      "region_rel": [0.20, 0.38, 0.80, 0.72],
                      "exclude": ["已领取"],
                      "delay": 1.2 },
                    { "type": "sleep", "seconds": 1.2 },
                    { "type": "if_text", "text": ["恭喜获得"], "min_score": 0.4,
                      "then": [ { "type": "click_rel", "rel": [0.5, 0.9375], "delay": 1.0, "name": "关闭恭喜获得" } ] }
                ] },
              { "type": "close_dialog", "anchor": "提示", "only_types": ["corner_pink_small", "corner"], "delay": 1.0,
                "_note": "阶段一: 关掉「时长礼包」子面板" },
              { "type": "sleep", "seconds": 1.0 },
              { "type": "if_text", "text": ["时长礼包", "每日任务"], "min_score": 0.4,
                "_note": "BUG2 收尾守卫: 左侧导航仍在 → 说明画面还停在花灵派对主面板, 必须再关一次, 否则 7.3 会在错误界面上瞎跑",
                "then": [
                    { "type": "close_dialog", "delay": 1.0,
                      "_note": "阶段二: 关花灵派对主面板(全注册表探测关闭按钮)" },
                    { "type": "sleep", "seconds": 1.0 },
                    { "type": "if_text", "text": ["菜单", "离开"], "min_score": 0.4,
                      "_note": "回没回到家园的判据: 家园页面有「菜单」「离开」。不能用「奇妙花宝」判定——花灵派对与奇妙花宝是两个分立功能",
                      "else": [
                          { "type": "click_rel", "rel": [0.9711, 0.0389], "delay": 1.5,
                            "name": "花灵派对主面板右上角关闭(兜底, 已按 09-28 实测 (1243,28) 校准)" },
                          { "type": "sleep", "seconds": 1.0 },
                          { "type": "if_text", "text": ["菜单", "离开"], "min_score": 0.4,
                            "_note": "兜底点完再确认一次; 仍未回到家园就如实报出来, 不再假装成功",
                            "else": [
                                { "type": "close_dialog", "delay": 1.0,
                                  "_note": "最后手段: 交给关闭注册表探测一次" }
                            ] }
                      ] }
                ] }
          ],
          "else": [] },
        { "type": "if_config",
          "key": "claim_hb",
          "value": true,
          "then": [
              { "type": "retry_loop",
                "max_rounds": 6,
                "_note": "fail_do 原来是裸 sleep, 卡在未知界面时毫无脱困手段(2026-09-27 日志: 入口链 6 轮全空转)。现改为条件脱困: 已在目标界面/已在家园就只等待, 只有两者都不是时才 close_dialog 脱困一次 —— 绝不能在已打开面板时 close_dialog, 否则把刚打开的面板关掉, 形成开/关死循环",
                "fail_do": [
                    { "type": "if_text", "text": ["奇妙特权"], "min_score": 0.4,
                      "_note": "已在奇妙花宝界面: 只等一等, 下一轮点页签即可(点击可能被吞)",
                      "then": [ { "type": "sleep", "seconds": 2.0 } ],
                      "else": [
                          { "type": "if_text", "text": ["奇妙花宝"], "min_score": 0.4,
                            "region_rel": [0.06, 0.05, 0.22, 0.12],
                            "_note": "已在家园(顶部工具栏区域限定): 同样只等待, 下一轮重试点「奇妙花宝」",
                            "then": [ { "type": "sleep", "seconds": 2.0 } ],
                            "else": [
                                { "type": "close_dialog", "delay": 1.5,
                                  "_note": "既不在奇妙花宝界面也不在家园 → 卡在未知界面(弹窗/别的面板): 脱困一次, 下一轮再试" },
                                { "type": "sleep", "seconds": 0.5 }
                            ] }
                      ] }
                ],
                "do": [
                    { "type": "if_text", "text": ["奇妙特权"], "min_score": 0.4,
                      "scene": "奇妙花宝界面",
                      "then": [
                          { "type": "click_text", "text": ["奇妙特权"], "mark": true, "min_score": 0.4,
                            "delay": 4.0, "fallback_rel": [0.0945, 0.5306] }
                      ],
                      "else": [
                        { "type": "if_text", "text": ["奇妙花宝"], "min_score": 0.4,
                          "region_rel": [0.06, 0.05, 0.22, 0.12],
                          "scene": "家园主界面",
                          "then": [
                              { "type": "click_text", "text": ["奇妙花宝"], "min_score": 0.4,
                                "delay": 4.0, "fallback_rel": [0.1125, 0.0819] }
                          ],
                          "else": [
                              { "type": "click_text", "text": ["家园"], "min_score": 0.4,
                                "delay": 4.0, "fallback_rel": [0.8711, 0.95] }
                          ] },
                        { "type": "sleep", "seconds": 1.5 }
                      ] }
                ] },
              { "type": "if_text", "text": ["奇妙特权"], "min_score": 0.4,
                "_note": "P0-1 守卫: 进入链耗尽仍未确认已在面板时整段跳过; 不得在未知界面采样色块/盲点三档「领」",
                "then": [
                    { "type": "if_color_count",
                      "name": "每日礼包未领 -> 点该档「领」",
                      "hsv_lower": [35, 40, 40],
                      "hsv_upper": [85, 255, 255],
                      "area_min": 100,
                      "area_max": 999999,
                      "region_rel": [0.86, 0.16, 0.95, 0.28],
                      "op": "<",
                      "threshold": 1,
                      "then": [
                          { "type": "click_rel", "rel": [0.9055, 0.2861], "delay": 2.0, "name": "领每日礼包" },
                          { "type": "sleep", "seconds": 1.5 },
                          { "type": "if_text", "text": ["恭喜获得"], "min_score": 0.4,
                            "then": [ { "type": "click_rel", "rel": [0.5, 0.9375], "delay": 1.5, "name": "关闭恭喜获得" } ] }
                      ] },
                    { "type": "if_color_count",
                      "name": "每周礼包未领 -> 点该档「领」",
                      "hsv_lower": [35, 40, 40],
                      "hsv_upper": [85, 255, 255],
                      "area_min": 100,
                      "area_max": 999999,
                      "region_rel": [0.86, 0.33, 0.95, 0.45],
                      "op": "<",
                      "threshold": 1,
                      "then": [
                          { "type": "click_rel", "rel": [0.9039, 0.4903], "delay": 2.0, "name": "领每周礼包" },
                          { "type": "sleep", "seconds": 1.5 },
                          { "type": "if_text", "text": ["恭喜获得"], "min_score": 0.4,
                            "then": [ { "type": "click_rel", "rel": [0.5, 0.9375], "delay": 1.5, "name": "关闭恭喜获得" } ] }
                      ] },
                    { "type": "if_color_count",
                      "name": "每月礼包未领 -> 点该档「领」",
                      "hsv_lower": [35, 40, 40],
                      "hsv_upper": [85, 255, 255],
                      "area_min": 100,
                      "area_max": 999999,
                      "region_rel": [0.86, 0.56, 0.95, 0.70],
                      "op": "<",
                      "threshold": 1,
                      "then": [
                          { "type": "click_rel", "rel": [0.9000, 0.7208], "delay": 2.0, "name": "领每月礼包" },
                          { "type": "sleep", "seconds": 1.5 },
                          { "type": "if_text", "text": ["恭喜获得"], "min_score": 0.4,
                            "then": [ { "type": "click_rel", "rel": [0.5, 0.9375], "delay": 1.5, "name": "关闭恭喜获得" } ] }
                      ] },
                    { "type": "if_text", "text": ["奇妙特权"], "min_score": 0.4,
                      "then": [
                          { "type": "click_rel", "rel": [0.9731, 0.0356], "delay": 2.0,
                            "name": "关闭奇妙花宝面板(右上粉色X)" }
                      ] }
                ] }
          ],
          "else": [] }
    ]
}